    "https://careers.k-state.edu/jobs/intern-diagnostic-medicine-manhattan-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "Intern - Diagnostic Medicine",
      "description": "Intern - Diagnostic Medicine - Manhattan, Kansas, United States Intern - Diagnostic Medicine - Manhattan, Kansas, United States Kiosk mode Intern - Diagnostic Medicine Apply Now Intern - Diagnostic Medicine The purpose of the position is to offer quality of after-hours testing performed by the clinical pathology laboratory while at the same time train veterinarians who want to advance their diagnostic skills and/or those who are hoping to pursue advanced training in the field of veterinary diagnostic medicine. 522357 Manhattan, Kansas, United States Veterinary Diagnostic Lab Staff Full Time (Unclassified - Term) Closing at: Dec 1 2026 - 23:55 CST On-site Add to favorites View favorites About This Role The purpose of the position is to offer quality of after-hours testing performed by the clinical pathology laboratory while at the same time train veterinarians who want to advance their diagnostic skills and/or those who are hoping to pursue advanced training in the field of veterinary diagnostic medicine. Worksite Description This position is On-site . All employees must reside in the United States when they begin working to comply with state law. K-State is unable to provide remote or hybrid work opportunities for residents of the state of Idaho. What You'll Need to Succeed Minimum Qualifications: - Doctorate in Veterinary Medicine or equivalent Preferred Qualifications: - General practice experience is preferred - Doctorate in Veterinary Medicine or equivalent Additional Role Information: - Requirements include: interest in veterinary diagnostic medicine, excellent written and verbal communication skills, attention to detail, ability to arrive to perform after hours tests within 20 min. of being paged - Use of clinical pathology laboratory equipment (e.g., chemistry, blood gas, coagulation, and blood analyzers, centrifuges, and microscope). Sponsorship eligibility: This position is eligible for sponsorship. How to Apply Please submit the following documents: 1. Resume 2. Cover Letter 3. Contact information for three professional references Application Window Applications close on: December 1, 2026 Anticipated Hiring Pay Range $44,634.98 Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) 5e8f2c16 Last Name (required) c7bdb31e Email (required) d1500e53 Select one or more from the lists below to receive information about specific jobs: 3c585ab8 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Veterinary Medicine Veterinary Medicine Employment Type Staff Full Time (Unclassified - Term) Staff Full Time (Unclassified - Term) Locations Manhattan, Kansas, United States Manhattan, Kansas, United States Worksite On-site On-site Sign Up! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Save this job for later Add this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later (required) 23f77c5f Last Name (required) 538cf885 Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later f9315e9f Save Now! Please wait... Done Not You? We sent this job to you Share this job with a friend First Name (required) 05710f1a Last Name (required) 9cde56a6 Email (required) 73379935 Provide your friend's name and email and we'll send this job 481b720c Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? Thanks for sharing this job! You may also be interested in Graphic Designer Manhattan 3670006010 Div Comm and Mrktg Marketing & Member Strategist Other AQ Miller Schl of Media & Comm Landscape Technician II Manhattan Department of Housing & Dining Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip Forward Mute Current Time 0:00 / Duration 1:46 Loaded : 0.00% 0:00 Stream Type LIVE Seek to live, currently behind live LIVE Remaining Time - 1:46 1x Playback Rate Chapters Chapters Des