    "https://careers.k-state.edu/jobs/custodial-specialist-manhattan-kansas-united-states-e9c6efbf-8ab8-4fea-af20-042a04b394fe": {
      "title": "Custodial Specialist",
      "description": "Custodial Specialist - Manhattan, Kansas, United States Custodial Specialist - Manhattan, Kansas, United States Kiosk mode Custodial Specialist Apply Now Custodial Specialist This position exists to provide cleaning and sanitation in the various areas at the Vet Med Complex at KSU. Subject to on-call, standby and inclement weather response. This position is considered essential. Responsible to know, understand, and follow safety guidelines in accordance with the Occupational Safety and Health Administration regulations, to include K-State and Facilities policies and procedures. Responsible to comply with the safe work practices identified in the departmental Job Hazard Analysis, Personal Protective Equipment Assessment and Departmental Safety Orientation Acknowledgment form. Responsible for the implementation of safety regulations, guidelines and work practices to prevent injury to yourself and others. 522454 Manhattan, Kansas, United States Vet Med Support Services Staff Full Time (USS) Closing at: Nov 16 2026 - 23:55 CST On-site Add to favorites View favorites About This Role This position exists to provide cleaning and sanitation in the various areas at the Vet Med Complex at KSU. Subject to on-call, standby and inclement weather response. This position is considered essential. Responsible to know, understand, and follow safety guidelines in accordance with the Occupational Safety and Health Administration regulations, to include K-State and Facilities policies and procedures. Responsible to comply with the safe work practices identified in the departmental Job Hazard Analysis, Personal Protective Equipment Assessment and Departmental Safety Orientation Acknowledgment form. Responsible for the implementation of safety regulations, guidelines and work practices to prevent injury to yourself and others. Worksite Description This position is On-site . All employees must reside in the United States when they begin working to comply with state law. K-State is unable to provide remote or hybrid work opportunities for residents of the state of Idaho. What You'll Need to Succeed Preferred Qualifications: Prefer experience performing custodial tasks in a hospital environment or in a commercial setting requiring specific sanitation procedures. Be able to learn the operation of a wide variety of commercial janitorial equipment and understand/follow explicit instructions in English, both in oral and written form. Sponsorship eligibility: Candidates must be legally authorized to work in the U.S. on an ongoing basis without sponsorship. How to Apply Resume Application Window Applications close: November 16, 2026 Anticipated Hiring Pay Range $15.00 - $17.00/hr Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) a96ec411 Last Name (required) 24433c2f Email (required) 280726b3 Select one or more from the lists below to receive information about specific jobs: ccb4c6cb Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Custodial / Landscaping / Maintenance Custodial / Landscaping / Maintenance Employment Type Staff Full Time (USS) Staff Full Time (USS) Locations Manhattan, Kansas, United States Manhattan, Kansas, United States Worksite On-site On-site Sign Up! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Save this job for later Add this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later (required) 4fce6438 Last Name (required) 270a33f6 Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later f68977dc Save Now! Please wait... Done Not You? We sent this job to you Share this job with a friend First Name (required) 7e11560c Last Name (required) a67ad184 Email (required) 04ee6b01 Provide your friend's name and email and we'll send this job 863ee08a Share No